bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    engine2d_interp_cold_glyph_and_image_scale_cost_2026-11-13, 0, "After the 2026-11-13 full-res render fix the interpreted cpu Engine2D still pays about 2.0s once per process in _glyf_edge_coverage for 24 glyphs, about 21ms per sfnt_cmap_glyph_id call because parse_cmap_format12 re-validates every group (2 calls per cold glyph), about 150ms per frame in _emu_scale_image_pixels for one 638x60 image, and about 29s for one 640x480 draw_rect_blend. Also [u32].sum() returns 0 under SIMPLE_EXECUTION_MODE=interpret but the right value under JIT. Lane hazard: the pipeline is interpreted only because backend_vulkan.spl calls env_get unimported; with the import added the bench JIT-compiles (36s) and exits SIGSEGV after the render loop. Related: interp_indexed_array_store_regression_2026-11-11."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    engine2d_interp_cold_glyph_and_image_scale_cost_2026-11-13, P3, closed, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep2-20261127 (image-scale column-map + same-source-row copy: 261 to 199 ms/frame on this lane, ~6x on the doc's aarch64 lane; divisions 38,280 to 638 per call; glyph/cmap/blend items verified already fixed at tip); budget spec 3/3 PASS 2026-11-27. Was: Interpreted Engine2D cold glyph rasterization and image scale cost", cmap re-parse, image scale and draw_rect_blend stay per-pixel or per-call slow", doc/08_tracking/bug/engine2d_interp_cold_glyph_and_image_scale_cost_2026-11-13.md, 1, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-13, 2026-11-27, true

