    engine2d_interp_cold_glyph_and_image_scale_cost_2026-11-13, fixing, p3sweep2-20261127, 2026-11-27T18:05:35Z, 2026-11-27T18:05:35Z, open, "wave8"

    engine2d_interp_cold_glyph_and_image_scale_cost_2026-11-13, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep2-61127: measured the doc's scenario library-level on the forced interpreter lane (SIMPLE_EXECUTION_MODE=interpret; the doc's full widget bench does not compile on this branch - theme.spl fluid_dark/fluid_light are private but imported by widget_draw_ir.spl since 63e592f66a8, other lane's item). Findings vs the doc: cmap re-parse (~81 ms/call here vs ~21 ms doc) and glyph outline coverage (~5.0 s vs 2.0 s, the rest being the cross-referenced interp_indexed_array_store_regression) and draw_rect_blend (SIMD span path) are ALL already fixed in the pipeline (FontRenderer index-selector re-point font_renderer.spl:2562 + per-face ASCII gid warm :85; span-coverage sweep _glyf_raster_alpha sfnt_glyf.spl:663; backend_software.spl:498). The ONE live item was src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/engine2d/backend_emu_adv.spl:23 _emu_scale_image_pixels - per-pixel double loop with an i64 division per destination pixel for the source column and every row re-mapped even when consecutive destination rows share one source row (58 of 60 redundant for the 2x2 to 638x60 stretch). Fix (byte-identical values, same private signature, no API change): column map [i64] built once per call with the SAME dx*src_w/dst_w expression; consecutive rows with equal sy copy the previous result row. Result: 261 to 199 ms/frame here (~1.3x), est ~150 to ~25 ms on the doc's aarch64 lane (~6x); divisions per call 38,280 to 638. Spec test/05_perf/gui/engine2d_interp_image_scale_budget_spec.spl (new, sibling convention): 2 byte-identity pins vs the original per-pixel definition (upscale + downscale) + best-of-3 per-frame budget 500 ms with measured before/after documented - 3/3 PASS (E2D_BUDGET image_scale_638x60_per_frame_ms=186 budget_ms=500); engine2d_interp_full_res_render_budget 3/3, backend_lane_order_parity 5/5 PASS; hot-path loop gate: no new violations (my edit also cleared one baselined violation); cpu-lane-loop-ok annotations on the new loops. Residuals (pre-existing, baseline-verified by reverting and re-running): draw_ir_adv 69/70, facade_backend_mutation 10/11, software_offscreen_dispatch 0/3 fail identically without the change (glass-opacity drift, SoftwareBackend's own scaler aliasing test, engine.sol source-pinned routing contract); the doc's bench blocked by the theme.spl privacy (other lane); non-ASCII cold glyphs still pay per-call cmap re-parses where the ASCII gid warm table cannot answer (separate change); note: simple run --mode=interpreter does NOT force the interpreter lane (program-args capture) - use SIMPLE_EXECUTION_MODE=interpret or simple test (docs note worth landing). close_evidence reproducer=test/05_perf/gui/engine2d_interp_image_scale_budget_spec.spl prevention=test/05_perf/gui/engine2d_interp_full_res_render_budget_spec.spl"
